diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -143,6 +143,11 @@

 ### crASHink patch updates

+- Added: tap saved highlights for on-page edge handles and a nearby Edit button. Dragging hides Edit; releasing saves the resized range while preserving text on other pages. Uncertain text mappings keep the full editor available without guessing a boundary.
+- Changed: hold still for dictionary lookup (600 ms); hold briefly (200 ms) then drag to create a highlight. Dictionary lookup also works on highlighted words.
+- Changed: saved clippings open directly in the full editor, with Save, Open, Delete and a top-right close button. Save is disabled when the selection matches the original, including after reversing changes.
+- Performance: cache nearby words and queue word-control clicks during e-ink refreshes instead of rescanning the chapter for every click.
+
 - Changed: touchscreen page turns use swipes only; removed tap page-turn settings.

 - Keep every clipping reachable when TOC labels overlap: group by logical chapter and saved title, refresh on store changes, and freeze each rendered row window during navigation. Failed previews remain visible as selectable entries.
